:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-21T09:05:27-08:00","id":1161178,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ghost</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1158815-arms-of-the-chosen?p=1161059#post1161059\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Vance posted a Miracle of Sound song. When Gavin is being referenced then the only polite thing to do is to bring up another one of his songs. It's just good manners <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.</div> </div> </div> </div>... Vance? I'm Vance?<br /> <br /> Well I guess that nobody's ever seen him and me in the same place at the same time. O_o","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-21T09:14:44-08:00","id":1161182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1158815-arms-of-the-chosen?p=1161178#post1161178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... Vance? I'm Vance?<br /> <br /> Well I guess that nobody's ever seen him and me in the same place at the same time. O_o</div> </div> </div> </div>........I really shouldn't have posted when tired. I least if I didn't I would have had a cleaver excuse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1882-ghost","name":"Ghost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1882_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-21T11:43:48-08:00","id":1161224,"title":"","content":"I was a little surprised at how many of the evocations built off f solar charms. I don't have problems with these evocations for themselves but if I'm running a dragon blooded game or a game of mixed exalts it's really likely that some of the PC's with artefacts will not be Solars and while doing conversions will (I suspect) be conceptually pretty easy there's just a greater proportion of solar specific stuff in the book than I had anticipated.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I want to play <a href=\"https://forum.atlas-games.com/t/adelbert-a-magi-of-hermes-look-at-intellego-and-astrology/8146/382\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> as a starting character, I don't even care what game.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","name":"Apromor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar872_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-21T11:54:06-08:00","id":1161230,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Apromor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1158815-arms-of-the-chosen?p=1161224#post1161224\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was a little surprised at how many of the evocations built off f solar charms. I don't have problems with these evocations for themselves but if I'm running a dragon blooded game or a game of mixed exalts it's really likely that some of the PC's with artefacts will not be Solars and while doing conversions will (I suspect) be conceptually pretty easy there's just a greater proportion of solar specific stuff in the book than I had anticipated.</div> </div> </div> </div>The idea was to gate stuff behind solar charms that the writrs figured would be game-breaking or at least unbalancing to put in the hands of other exalts. For instance, any jade artifact would resonate with Dragon Bloods but there are some charms that they figured were way above what Dragon Bloods should have access to.<br /> <br /> As you say though, there's a surprising number of them in the book.<br /> <br /> Perhaps when &quot;What Fire has Wrought&quot; and other splatbooks drop we'll get other artifacts with evocations gated behind their charms that deal with splat-specific goodies.<br /> <br /> Edit: What what it's worth, I'd be surprised if we don't get an artifact with shapeshifting evocations gated behind lunar charms for instance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","name":"armyofwhispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-21T12:25:23-08:00","id":1161245,"title":"","content":"Vance responded to this subject <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1069023-ask-the-devs?p=1160262#post1160262\">in this post here</a>. The summary though, is that it's totally fine for a Dragon-blood or Lunar or whoever to potentially gain access to a similar evocation through a similar native charm.<br /> <br /> (My thoughts) We saw Solar-only in the book because those are the only published charms out so far, but that doesn't mean that none of the other splats could use those artifacts because only Solar charms get them there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-21T12:37:50-08:00","id":1161250,"title":"","content":"Pretty much the only hardline limitation would be ones that say you need to be resonant to acquire the charm, but there's nothing to my mind stopping another splat from acquiring a variant on an evocation based on their own capabilities. I mean Asphodel has an example where it mentions modifying a dragonblood power just on the grounds that the DB base power requires a mirror, so the modified evocation requires a mirror.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-21T13:38:43-08:00","id":1161261,"title":"","content":"I think the Custom Evocations section was very important to putting things such as powers with Solar Charms either as prerequisites, or the subject of enhancement, into the proper context. That it doesn't imply that somebody other than a Solar wielding the Artifact can't use it to the fullest because some Evocations are non-functional or inaccessible, because the whole configuration is assumed to rearrange as necessary.<br /> <br /> \u200bEven if does mean that some Evocations wind up being necessarily weaker because they don't let you freely use Charms that are as strong, and maybe imply that a couple shouldn't be as powerful in the hands of another Exalt, but I find it to be an important distinction nevertheless.<br /> <br /> \u200bAt the same time, there's something valuable in putting references to Solar Charms throughout, and not just because they're the only ones released so far. It both reinforces the notion of their mastery, and provides an effective example of the powers of weapon and wielder being in tandem, rather than the former rendering the latter irrelevant. I know of some people hostile to the principle of magic weapons in general who may possibly revise the position with the idea that Evocations include the ability to enhance Solar Charms that are resonant with the Artifact's legend or temperament.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-21T22:07:41-08:00","id":1161422,"title":"","content":"Another section I thought was well done was the siege section. Custom tag, rules for use, basic stats, and the repair rules were easy to parse through. I really liked the &quot;if you don't have this skill you can use this other skill instead&quot; bits for both repair and usage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/977-major","name":"Major","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar977_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T06:13:08-08:00","id":1161489,"title":"","content":"And it's hit Platinum on DriveThru (hat-tip to Vance for mentioning it on Twitter).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T09:47:00-08:00","id":1161537,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ghost</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1158815-arms-of-the-chosen?p=1161182#post1161182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ........I really shouldn't have posted when tired. I least if I didn't I would have had a cleaver excuse.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, I think I see how it happened. I have the Chibi Perfect Soul Sketch as an avatar, he has the Chibi Shen Sketch as his, if you're tired and don't really look too hard at them-","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T15:38:39-08:00","id":1161630,"title":"","content":"I've finally realized that there is something I don't like about Arms. We didn't see a return of Trauma Bear.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-dMPYPVn1Aq0/Vi6NCeUzfiI/AAAAAAABwY4/23NSKJATy5g/w320-h305-no/Bear_2.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T16:04:38-08:00","id":1161639,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1158815-arms-of-the-chosen?p=1161630#post1161630\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've finally realized that there is something I don't like about Arms. We didn't see a return of Trauma Bear.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-dMPYPVn1Aq0/Vi6NCeUzfiI/AAAAAAABwY4/23NSKJATy5g/w320-h305-no/Bear_2.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>I almost posted this exact thing today. I'd love to see trauma bear snuck into many books as we go. Also Frosty Dorito Island.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T16:10:42-08:00","id":1161640,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1158815-arms-of-the-chosen?p=1161639#post1161639\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I almost posted this exact thing today. I'd love to see trauma bear snuck into many books as we go. Also Frosty Dorito Island.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> In all seriousness I wish they'd name said island, canonically state little is known about it since few go there and return, and leave it at that for tables to fill in. The status quo of not mentioning it at all just leaves it being called Frosty Dorito Island by fans which leaves it being seen as something silly rather than existing for the purpose it was actually drawn for (being an isolated Arctic type local where you can do stories like &quot;The Thing&quot; or any given Doctor Who story that's about a bunch of people trapped in a place together where something weird starts happening).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T16:27:56-08:00","id":1161648,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1158815-arms-of-the-chosen?p=1161640#post1161640\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> In all seriousness I wish they'd name said island, canonically state little is known about it since few go there and return, and leave it at that for tables to fill in. The status quo of not mentioning it at all just leaves it being called Frosty Dorito Island by fans which leaves it being seen as something silly rather than existing for the purpose it was actually drawn for (being an isolated Arctic type local where you can do stories like &quot;The Thing&quot; or any given Doctor Who story that's about a bunch of people trapped in a place together where something weird starts happening).</div> </div> </div> </div>We're planning to cover it in an upcoming setting book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T16:34:10-08:00","id":1161650,"title":"","content":"Are we sure Trauma Bear isn't one of the figures Karvara is shown tossing toward its maw? I was too captivated by the Devil Tower to pay much attention to its snacks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T16:42:03-08:00","id":1161652,"title":"","content":"Those are very, very obviously humans.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T16:43:42-08:00","id":1161654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Minton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1158815-arms-of-the-chosen?p=1161648#post1161648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> We're planning to cover it in an upcoming setting book.</div> </div> </div> </div>This sounds like a reasonable way to soothe SLS's heart over the whole frosty dorito thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T16:56:53-08:00","id":1161659,"title":"","content":"For me it shall always be Frosty Dorito Island.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://foru